<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ASEAN ATTRIB LOSS DEEPENS IN 18-MO PERIOD.</title>
<headline>ASEAN ATTRIB LOSS DEEPENS IN 18-MO PERIOD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 18 months</p>
<p>ended December 31, 1996 vs 12 months ended June 30, 1996 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib loss (cts)  129.5	 vs 8.7</p>
<p>    Attrib loss		 19.42	 vs 1.30</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     3.68	  vs 2.16</p>
<p>    Operating loss	    10.22	 vs 1.03 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		    68.86	 vs 58.84</p>
<p>Full name: Asean Investment Corp Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 5.52 loss   vs 0.20 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the financial year end had been</p>
<p>changed to December 31, hence the results reflect an 18-month</p>
<p>period.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
